### 1. Register a Native Webhook Endpoint
# @name createEndpoint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/webhook-endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9001/webhook",
  "mode": "native",
  "events": [
    "payment.captured",
    "payment.failed",
    "order.paid"
  ],
  "secret": "sample_secret_key_1234567890abcdef",
  "description": "Local Development Webhook Receiver"
}

###

### 2. Register a Razorpay Compatibility Mode Webhook Endpoint
# @name createCompatEndpoint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/webhook-endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9001/compat/webhook",
  "mode": "compatibility",
  "events": [
    "payment.captured",
    "payment.failed",
    "order.paid"
  ],
  "secret": "sample_secret_key_1234567890abcdef",
  "description": "Razorpay Compatible Receiver"
}

###

### 3. List All Webhook Endpoints
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/webhook-endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}

###

### 4. Rotate Webhook Endpoint Secret (Produces Version 2)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/webhook-endpoints/{{endpointId}}/rotate-secret
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newSecret": "rotated_secret_key_1234567890abcdef"
}
